From: Aishwarya R <aishwarya.r@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 12 May 2026 10:54:54 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] DSCP: Parse policy queries and send solicitied request

Parse QoS Management elements to extract and validate query
attributes(TCLAS Type 4, domain name, port range). Build internal query
structures and normalize Type 4 classifier parameters for IPv4/IPv6.

Implement query parsing for one or more QoS Management elements,
including wildcard query detection. Add policy-match logic to compare
parsed queries against per-STA DSCP policies.

Construct and transmit DSCP Policy Request frames in response to valid
STA-initiated DSCP policy queries per Wi-Fi Alliance QoS Management
spec. Support fragmentation and the More bit, and honor the DSCP reset
flag.

Backport of hostap commit 35245b849a7f.

Signed-off-by: Aishwarya R <aishwarya.r@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
